cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software for the Python port. Cite Flint, Flint, and Stern
  (2021) and the USGS BCM page for the Basin Characterization Model.
title: bcm-py-daily
abstract: >-
  Independent daily Python implementation of the USGS Basin
  Characterization Model (BCM). Not a USGS product.
authors:
